
== T1a EOQ check interval: cost rate c/T + w*sig^2*T/2 ==
T* = sqrt(2)*sqrt(c)/(sigma*sqrt(w)) | J* = sqrt(2)*sqrt(c)*sigma*sqrt(w)
J(x T*)/J* = (x**2 + 1)/(2*x)   (= cosh(ln x))
penalty at x=2: 1.25  x=sqrt2: 1.0606601717798212  x=10: 5.05

