sigma=1: MC cost 1.396 vs sigma*sqrt(2cw) 1.414
sigma=2: MC cost 2.914 vs sigma*sqrt(2cw) 2.828

== T1c Kalman steady-state gain for random walk + noise: K^2/(1-K) = q/r ==
K(z) = sqrt(z)*sqrt(z + 4)/2 - z/2 | series: z**(3/2)/8 + sqrt(z) - z/2

== T1d misspecified gain penalty, EWMA MSE(a) = [(1-a)^2 q + a^2 r]/[a(2-a)] ==
