== T5 rise-then-fall: bounded staleness loss (Cho & Garcia-Molina form) ==
marginal freshness at f->0+: 1/lambda  => refreshing pays iff mu*W/lambda > c, i.e. lambda < mu W / c
F concave in f? d2F/df2 = -lambda*exp(-lambda/f)/f**3
  d2F/df2 < 0 on grid f in [0.01,100] (lambda=1): True  (F depends on f/lambda only, so this covers all lambda)
  f*(lambda), mu=1 W=10 c=1: [(0.001, np.float64(0.07)), (0.1, np.float64(0.673)), (1, np.float64(1.88)), (3, np.float64(2.734)), (5, np.float64(2.979)), (7, np.float64(2.87)), (9, np.float64(2.314)), (9.9, np.float64(1.491)), (10.1, 0.0), (20, 0.0)]

