== T7a-extra convexity of the band penalty phi(D) = (2/D) sinh(D/2) - 1 (needed for the Jensen step) ==
series of phi: D**2/24 + D**4/1920 + O(D**6)
phi''(D) > 0 on grid D in [0.01, 30]: True
(all Taylor coefficients of phi are positive: phi = sum_k D^{2k}/(4^k (2k+1)!), so phi is convex on D > 0)
